#compdef setbg
#
# Completion for setbg (config/bin/setbg). It takes one background word --
# `light` or `dark`, the variant of the current scheme to symlink into each
# app's theme dir -- and prints usage for anything else. Both are always
# accepted whatever is currently set, so nothing here reads the disk.
#
# $fpath carries the live checkout (modules/magi.nix), so this starts completing
# as soon as `magi reload` has dropped the compdump and a new shell starts.

_arguments \
  '1:background:((light\:"the light variant of the current scheme" dark\:"the dark variant of the current scheme"))'
